            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Two numbers have a sum of 36 and a difference of 2. Find the numbers.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "19 and 17.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ be the larger number and $y$ the smaller number.\n$$\\begin{align*}x+y&=36&&\\text{(1)}\\\\x-y&=2&&\\text{(2)}\\end{align*}$$\nAdding equations (1) and (2):\n$$\\begin{align*}2x&=38\\\\x&=19\\end{align*}$$\nSubstituting $x=19$ into equation (1):\n$$\\begin{align*}19+y&=36\\\\y&=17\\end{align*}$$\nThe numbers are 19 and 17. Check: $19+17=36$ and $19-17=2$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
